# BAB 10. CI/CD and Release Management

## 10.1 Overview

Bab ini mendefinisikan arsitektur *Continuous Integration/Continuous Delivery* (CI/CD) dan strategi manajemen rilis yang memungkinkan **independent deployment** per layanan (NFR-013), rilis dengan gangguan minimal (NFR-006), serta evolusi API/skema tanpa *breaking change* (NFR-014). Pendekatan mengikuti prinsip **GitOps** dan menyatu dengan keamanan (BAB 7.10) dan observability (BAB 9).

Setiap layanan (SVC-xxx) memiliki pipeline independen sehingga dapat dibangun, diuji, dan dirilis tanpa menghentikan layanan lain (ADR-001).

---

## 10.2 Pipeline Stages

```text
[Commit/PR] → Build & Unit Test → Static Analysis & Security Scan →
              Containerize & Sign → Publish Artifact →
              Deploy (GitOps) → DB Migration Job → Post-Deploy Verification →
              (gagal) Automated Rollback
```

| Tahap                     | Aktivitas                                                                  | Gerbang Kualitas (*gate*)          |
| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Build & Unit Test         | Kompilasi Go / build web-spa; uji unit; *coverage*.                         | *Coverage* minimum terpenuhi.      |
| Static Analysis & Security| *Linting*, **SAST**, **SCA** (CVE), *secret scan*.                         | Tidak ada temuan kritikal.         |
| Contract/Schema Check     | Validasi **OpenAPI** & kompatibilitas skema **Apicurio** (§10.6).          | Kompatibel (backward/forward).     |
| Containerize & Sign       | Build image Docker; *image scan*; *image signing*.                         | Image bersih & tertandatangani.    |
| Publish Artifact          | Push image ke registry internal.                                           | Artefak ter-versi.                 |
| Deploy (GitOps)           | Argo CD men-*sync* manifest ke Kubernetes.                                 | *Sync* sukses.                     |
| DB Migration Job          | Migrasi *expand–contract* (§10.4) sebagai *job* pra/pasca-deploy.          | Migrasi idempoten sukses.          |
| Post-Deploy Verification  | *Smoke test*, *health check* (BAB 9.8).                                    | Sehat → selesai; gagal → rollback. |

