## 10.3 GitOps and Per-Service Pipelines

| Prinsip                  | Realisasi                                                              | Referensi        |
| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| GitOps                   | Git sebagai *single source of truth* untuk manifest; **Argo CD** men-*reconcile* state klaster. | ADR-004          |
| Pipeline per layanan     | Setiap SVC memiliki pipeline & siklus rilis independen.               | NFR-013, ADR-001 |
| Environment promotion    | Promosi artefak dev → staging → prod melalui perubahan manifest ter-*review*. | §10.9            |
| Declarative & auditable  | Perubahan deployment tercatat di Git (auditable, dapat di-*rollback*). | NFR-018          |

